<title>USA: Diversified Investors sells unit.</title>
<headline>Diversified Investors sells unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified Investors Corp said on Tuesday it sold its Transaction Network Plus Inc subsidiary to American Banknote Corp for up to $675,000 in cash, stock and payout based on future events.</p>
<p>The electronic funds transfer unit would become part of American Banknote's transaction card and systems business, the company said.</p>
<p>Diversified said the company would now devote resoureces to its Internet Marketing Corp unit.</p>
</text>
